loper of Sokobomb, as he plays through the game. (Note, he did not design the puzzles, so he might struggle ːsteamhappyː)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T21:09:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692762","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4866020-1846651706691891","game_id":"steam-4866020","kind":"announcement","title":"October Next Fest 2026 Giveaway!","summary":"Hello friends! Lee, here!With Next Fest officially going live! We are excited to announce a little contest! We are doing a draw to give away 10 free steam keys when the game launches. But, Lee, how do I participate?Well, fellow gamer, all you have to do is play the game and submit a video/gif of you completing the demo! You'll then be entered into our draw for a key to the final release of Sokobomb when the game releases on 19 November 2026!So, to summarize:Play the demoRecord a video of you col","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:43:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691891","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4866020-1842212951305952","game_id":"steam-4866020","kind":"announcement","title":"Final demo with brand new levels!","summary":"Hello, friends! Lee from Socially Awkward here.Exciting news today. In case you haven't noticed, we recently did a complete redo of our steam page. New trailers, new screenshots, new description: the works! On top of that, we have a brand new demo available! This is possibly the final version of the demo (unless we find some bugs).\"But, Lee\", you ask, \"You included every mechanic in the last demo! What more could there be?Well, this version contains completely new levels, with 2 levels from each","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T16:44:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951305952","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4866020-1841579228678365","game_id":"steam-4866020","kind":"update","title":"Small Patch Version 0.7.1","summary":"Hello friendsJust pushed a quick fix that reset players to the incorrect location in the Hotspring Biome. Sorry for the inconvenience! If you were affected, resetting the level in that biome will fix it.-Lee","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T13:50:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228678365","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4866020-1841579228673546","game_id":"steam-4866020","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.7 is Available!","summary":"Hello, friends! Lee from Socially Awkward here.We have added 2 new playground areas that introduce 2 new biomes: Snow Mountains and Hidden Hotspring.These 2 new areas introduce new mechanics for you to play around in. Here's a rundown of the new areas and mechanics in version 0.7.The Snowy Mountain area introduces ice. You can push square bombs or crates onto the ice and it will move across it until the ice stops, or something blocks the motion. The player will also slide through, and can even a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T14:56:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228673546","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4866020-1840944183784542","game_id":"steam-4866020","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.6 is Available!","summary":"Hello, friends! Lee from Socially Awkward here.It's time for an update! First and foremost, we have a preview: The Crystal Caves!In this new biome, there are sturdy walls that require multiple bombs to blow through. But more than that, there is a new area to access this preview that can be accessed pretty early on:Right at the beginning, there is a new path that will give you access to our playground. This will give you a sneak peak at the new biomes with the mechanics associated with each area.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-16T19:57:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183784542","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4866020-1839676055890852","game_id":"steam-4866020","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.5 is Available!","summary":"Hello, friends! Lee from Socially Awkward here.It's our second update, and we're introducing a preview of the third biome: The Mushroom Marsh!In this new biome, there's plenty of water to block your path. You can accidently toss your bombs into the water, or you can push crates over it to create new platforms!Here's a rundown of the changes in version 0.5Added mushroom marsh with water mechanicsFixed some issues with onboardingFixed some icons to reflect PC/XBox controllersPlease try it out, and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-01T14:46:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055890852","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4866020-1837955055362082","game_id":"steam-4866020","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.4.0 Released","summary":"Hello, friends! Lee from Socially Awkward here.This is our very first update! We received some feedback and made some changes, but we've also included a small preview of the second biome: The Dark Caves!In this new biome, we introduce boulders that roll when pushed! This can act as a hinderance, but can also be used as a stopper for rolling bombs and other boulders. And, yes, they can also be blown up!Here's a rundown of the changes in version 0.4Added dark cave biome with rolling bouldersAdded ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-12T23:51:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055362082","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4866020-1836506165577950","game_id":"steam-4866020","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is now available","summary":"Hello, friends! Lee from Socially Awkward here.Our demo is officially out! What are you waiting for? Get it now!If you have been lucky enough to catch us in any of our live events and managed to play the demo, this version has a few changes:Support for 17 Languages (it's all just UI, but still)Input mappingSome visual changes for tutorializationVarious minor bug fixesNow go and blow things up and let us know what you think!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-07T12:36:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165577950","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4866020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:54Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:53Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4866020":"2026-10-26T14:52:54Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4866020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:53Z","last_success_at":"2026-1